# "Second from the top" of a library that has one card is the bottom: Bot2's deck is nine cards, so after its turn-two draw one Forest
# is left and the Llanowar Elves go under it. Oust names a creature only: with a Mox Jet beside it on Bot2's battlefield, the Jet is
# refused as the target (the refusal) and the Elves are not (the positive control).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Oust
Plains x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Llanowar Elves
Mox Jet
Forest x6

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
! Bot1.Hand.Oust.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Jet)
Bot1.Hand.Oust.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves)

[Expect]
Bot2.Library = Forest; Llanowar Elves
Bot2.Life = 23
Bot2.Battlefield = Forest; Mox Jet
